{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20267J2aJ4pi581793269429.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>以色列大選選情膠著，反對派陣營領袖埃森科特被視為總理內塔內亞胡勁敵，有望打破其長達18年執政。</p><p></p><p>66歲的埃森科特，從政生涯只有短短4年，去年才成立「正直黨」，但已能與內塔內亞胡分庭抗禮，靠的究竟是甚麼呢？</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261029_QQ.ISR.EISENKOT.CLEAN_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026vRee1Pgj1z1793269442.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>埃森科特是米茲拉希，即來自中東和北非的猶太人，出生於摩洛哥移民家庭，與內塔內亞胡歐洲裔猶太人背景截然不同。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261029_QQ.ISR.EISENKOT.CLEAN_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026LEqMgkPRf91793269459.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>投身政壇前，軍人出身的埃森科特，曾任以色列國防軍總參謀長，2023年10月7日加沙戰事爆發後，更加入由內塔尼亞胡籌組的戰時內閣，但八個月後離任。</p><p></p><p>埃森科特幼子，以及兩名外甥均在加沙戰事中喪生，他多次要求針對戰事爆發成立國家調查委員會，並批評內塔尼亞胡拖延戰事。</p><p></p><p>這位政壇新星曾承諾，將於執政後18個月內，透過美國總統特朗普提出的和平方案，或以武力方式結束巴勒斯坦武裝組織哈瑪斯對加沙的管治。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/programme/17/episode/12014-%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%B7%E5%9C%8B%E5%82%B5%E6%81%AF%E5%B7%AE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">點擊觀看其他集數</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:21:46.515594+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":361,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T04:18:15.761995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T11:18:20.807196+00:00","content_hash":"db6a8011d171cb4b419d96ce80c14a57944d57e924f799e39c67bd647f7e298c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:21:46.515594+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}